                <h1 style="margin: 6pt 0 4pt 0; font-size: 19pt; color: #0f172a;">
                    Relational Division Operator Verification &amp; Algorithmic Analysis
                </h1>
                <div style="font-size: 11pt; font-style: italic; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8pt;">
                    Formal Algebraic Derivation, Multi-Paradigm SQL Compilation, and Strict Bijection Exact Division
                </div>
                <table style="width: 100%; border: none; margin: 0;">
